<title>USA: Dyersburg names William Shropshire CFO.</title>
<headline>Dyersburg names William Shropshire CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DYERSBURG, Tenn. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dyersburg Corp said on Tuesday that William Shropshire, a former Charter Bancshares executive, has joined the fabrics manufacturer as executive vice president-chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Dyersburg said Shropshire assumes the chief financial officer responsibilities from Paul Hallock, who had been serving as interim chief financial officer since April.</p>
<p>Shropshire had been chief financial officer at Charter Bancshares Inc since 1990, Dyersburg said.</p>
